en persist them.\\n\\nProtocol sketches (concise)\\n- Session Summarization Protocol (SSP)\\n  • Trigger: end-of-session or on request.\\n  • Content: What changed; new/updated artifacts with paths+hashes; pointers added; tokens/provenance used; open threads; next suggestions.\\n  • Format/paths: Markdown summary at /home/wizard/broca/logs/sessions/YYYY-MM-DD/SESSION_<ISO8601>.md (+ optional JSON metadata). Memory stores pointer meta only (AIMM).\\n- Boot-Up Protocol (BUP)\\n  • Trigger: first user message of a new session (pre-reply).\\n  • Steps: retrieve latest session summary pointer; load key pointers (schema, AIMM, Layering); present a short boot banner (invariants, recap time, open threads); then answer the prompt.\\n  • Enforcement: preflight check—if BUP not run yet this session, run it before responding. Reads only; no writes unless explicitly approved.\\n\\nState change (staged; not executing)\\n- Plan:\\n  • Create protocol artifacts: PROTOCOL.SESSION_SUMMARY.v0.1.md and PROTOCOL.BOOT_UP.v0.1.md under /home/wizard/broca/docs/protocols/.\\n  • Generate today’s session summary artifact draft (Markdown) capturing this session’s changes (schema, AIMM, Layering, Bio, pointers, tokens) at /home/wizard/broca/logs/sessions/2025-12-16/SESSION_2025-12-16T11-xxZ.md.\\n  • Add memory pointers (kind, artifact_path, version, sha256, last_update_iso) for both protocols and the session summary (AIMM).\\n- Plan approval status: pending by wizard (ref: chat-2025-12-16-protocols-01)\\n- Actuator token issuance status: pending\\n- Actuator token provenance: none/pending; verification method: inline escalation + operator approval; verification location: this transcript and session notes\\n- Memory write provenance: will record requester=wizard, timestamp, namespaces=broca.docs.protocols and user.profile.sessions/pointers (token not required by default)\\n- Execution status: Not executed\\n\\nEscalation\\n- Escalation scope: Create two protocol docs; create one session summary file; write 2–3 memory pointers; no deletes.\\n- Escalation duration/expiry: session-only; auto-expires at 2025-12-16T11:45:00Z or on “revoke”.\\n- Issuance authority: wizard (Nick Navid Yazdani).\\n- Token mapping: approval ref chat-2025-12-16-protocols-01 -> token ID LOCAL-EXC-2025-12-16-BOOT-03; issuer: local session exception; verification: inline escalation + chat approval; logging: session notes memory.\\n- Downgrade/rollback criteria: expiry/revoke; summarize partial writes with provenance.\\n- Post-escalation provenance: approval→token mapping and execution logs stored in session notes and this transcript.\\n\\nPreview: end-of-session recap (what I’ll persist if approved)\\n- Changes today: created you.schema (with timezone=Australia/Melbourne, daily_digest_time=18:00); established AIMM guideline; created Layering + Founder Bio; added pointers with hashes; used local exceptions LAYER-02 earlier.\\n- Open threads: add design priors to Layering v0.2; draft Daily Recap spec; implement BUP enforcement check; add schema pointer version/hash meta.\\n- Next actions: confirm protocols; run first boot-up tomorrow; execute 18:00 daily recap.\\n\\nSay “issue token BOOT-03” to proceed, or tweak anything (paths/fields).\\n\\nNext suggestions\\n- Approve and issue BOOT-03 so I can persist protocols + summary now.\\n- Confirm if you want JSON sidecars for summaries (y/n).\\n- Drop 3–5 design priors to add to Layering v0.2 (reversible-by-default, minimal ceremony, artifact-first, etc.).\"\n./conversations/dab54165-06c9-43d4-9b44-dcfceefe3f6a.json:490:      \"content\": \"Plan:\\n• Create protocol artifacts: /home/wizard/broca/docs/protocols/PROTOCOL.SESSION_SUMMARY.v0.1.md and PROTOCOL.BOOT_UP.v0.1.md.\\n• Generate today’s session summary Markdown + JSON sidecar under /home/wizard/broca/logs/sessions/2025-12-16/SESSION_<UTC_ISO>.{md,json}.\\n• Compute sha256 for the two protocols and the session summary; also compute hashes for key artifacts referenced.\\n• Write memory pointers for both protocol docs and the session summary (AIMM), plus a session note logging the BOOT-03 token use.\\n\\nPlan approval status: approved by wizard (chat-2025-12-16-protocols-01)\\n\\nActuator token issuance status: issued by wizard (LOCAL-EXC-2025-12-16-BOOT-03)\\n\\nActuator token provenance: token ID LOCAL-EXC-2025-12-16-BOOT-03; verification method: inline escalation + operator chat approval; verification location: this transcript and session notes memory\\n\\nMemory write provenance: requester=wizard, timestamp=now, namespaces=broca.docs.protocols; user.profile.sessions; token not required by default\\n\\nExecution status: Executing now\",\n./conversations/dab54165-06c9-43d4-9b44-dcfceefe3f6a.json:495:            \"arguments\": \"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"set -euo pipefail\\\\n# Create protocols\\\\nmkdir -p /home/wizard/broca/docs/protocols /home/wizard/broca/logs/sessions\\\\ncat > /home/wizard/broca/docs/protocols/PROTOCOL.SESSION_SUMMARY.v0.1.md << 'EOF'\\\\n# Session Summarization Protocol (SSP) v0.1\\\\n\\\\nPurpose\\\\n- Capture end-of-session changes with provenance so the next session can reliably boot context.\\\\n\\\\nTrigger\\\\n- End-of-session (operator request or assistant-detected wrap-up).\\\\n\\\\nContents (Markdown + JSON sidecar)\\\\n- What changed (artifacts created/updated) with paths and sha256 hashes.\\\\n- Pointers added/updated (namespaces, paths, versions, hashes).\\\\n- Tokens/provenance used during the session.\\\\n- Open threads and next suggestions.\\\\n\\\\nPaths\\\\n- Markdown: /home/wizard/broca/logs/sessions/YYYY-MM-DD/SESSION_<UTC_ISO>.md\\\\n- JSON:     /home/wizard/broca/logs/sessions/YYYY-MM-DD/SESSION_<UTC_ISO>.json\\\\n\\\\nProcess\\\\n1) Gather changes and hashes.\\\\n2) Render Markdown summary and JSON sidecar.\\\\n3) Update memory pointer (AIMM) to latest summary.\\\\n\\\\nAIMM Constraint\\\\n- Store only pointers/meta in memory; all content lives in artifacts.\\\\n\\\\nEOF\\\\n\\\\ncat > /home/wizard/broca/docs/protocols/PROTOCOL.BOOT_UP.v0.1.md << 'EOF'\\\\n# Boot-Up Protocol (BUP) v0.1\\\\n\\\\nPurpose\\\\n- Ensure each new session begins with the essential prior context loaded via pointers.\\\\n\\\\nTrigger\\\\n- First user message of a new session, before the assistant replies.\\\\n\\\\nSteps\\\\n1) Retrieve pointer to latest session summary.\\\\n2) Load key pointers: user schema, AIMM guideline, Layering doc (and others as needed).\\\\n3) Present a short boot banner (invariants, recap time, open threads) and then address the user prompt.\\\\n\\\\nEnforcement\\\\n- Preflight check: if BUP has not run in this session, run it before responding. Reads only; no writes unless explicitly approved.\\\\n\\\\nAIMM Constraint\\\\n- Use artifact pointers; do not store instance content in memory.\\\\n\\\\nEOF\\\\n\\\\n# Compute protocol hashes\\\\nPROT_SSP=\\\\\\\"/home/wizard/broca/docs/protocols/PROTOCOL.SESSION_SUMMARY.v0.1.md\\\\\\\"\\\\nPROT_BUP=\\\\\\\"/home/wizard/broca/docs/protocols/PROTOCOL.BOOT_UP.v0.1.md\\\\\\\"\\\\nSSP_HASH=$(sha256sum \\\\\\\"$PROT_SSP\\\\\\\" | awk '{print $1}')\\\\nBUP_HASH=$(sha256sum \\\\\\\"$PROT_BUP\\\\\\\" | awk '{print $1}')\\\\n\\\\n# Prepare session summary\\\\nDATE=$(date -u +%Y-%m-%d)\\\\nTS=$(date -u +%Y-%m-%dT%H-%M-%SZ)\\\\nSESSION_DIR=\\\\\\\"/home/wizard/broca/logs/sessions/$DATE\\\\\\\"\\\\nmkdir -p \\\\\\\"$SESSION_DIR\\\\\\\"\\\\nSUMMARY_MD=\\\\\\\"$SESSION_DIR/SESSION_${TS}.md\\\\\\\"\\\\nSUMMARY_JSON=\\\\\\\"$SESSION_DIR/SESSION_${TS}.json\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n# Compute hashes for referenced artifacts\\\\nAIMM_HASH=$(sha256sum /home/wizard/broca/docs/guidelines/USAGE_PATTERN.AIMM.v0.1.md | awk '{print $1}')\\\\nLAYER_HASH=$(sha256sum /home/wizard/broca/BROCA_LAYERING.v0.1.md | awk '{print $1}')\\\\nBIO_HASH=$(sha256sum /home/wizard/broca/user/FOUNDERS_BIO_SNAPSHOT.v0.1.md | awk '{print $1}')\\\\nSCHEMA_HASH=$(sha256sum /home/wizard/broca/user/schema/you.schema.v0.1.json | awk '{print $1}')\\\\n\\\\n# Render Markdown summary\\\\ncat > \\\\\\\"$SUMMARY_MD\\\\\\\" << EOF\\\\n# Session Summary ($TS UTC)\\\\n\\\\nChanges\\\\n- Schema artifact updated: /home/wizard/broca/user/schema/you.schema.v0.1.json (sha256=$SCHEMA_HASH)\\\\n  • Added timezone=Australia/Melbourne; daily_digest_time=18:00; pointers to Layering + Founder Bio.\\\\n- AIMM guideline created: /home/wizard/broca/docs/guidelines/USAGE_PATTERN.AIMM.v0.1.md (sha256=$AIMM_HASH)\\\\n- Layering doc created: /home/wizard/broca/BROCA_LAYERING.v0.1.md (sha256=$LAYER_HASH)\\\\n- Founder Bio created: /home/wizard/broca/user/FOUNDERS_BIO_SNAPSHOT.v0.1.md (sha256=$BIO_HASH)\\\\n- Protocols created: $PROT_SSP (sha256=$SSP_HASH), $PROT_BUP (sha256=$BUP_HASH)\\\\n\\\\nPointers Added/Updated (AIMM)\\\\n- broca.docs.guidelines → AIMM guideline (v0.1, sha256=$AIMM_HASH)\\\\n- user.profile.pointers → Layering (v0.1, sha256=$LAYER_HASH), Founder Bio (v0.1, sha256=$BIO_HASH)\\\\n- broca.docs.protocols → SSP (v0.1, sha256=$SSP_HASH), BUP (v0.1, sha256=$BUP_HASH)\\\\n- Latest session summary pointer → this file (sha256 to follow below)\\\\n\\\\nTokens/Provenance Used\\\\n- LOCAL-EXC-2025-12-16T09:26:16Z-01 (schema creation/update, pointer notes)\\\\n- LOCAL-EXC-2025-12-16-LAYER-02 (layering + bio + schema pointers)\\\\n- LOCAL-EXC-2025-12-16-BOOT-03 (protocols + session summary)\\\\n\\\\nOpen Threads\\\\n- Add 3–5 design priors → Layering v0.2\\\\n- Draft Daily Recap Spec v0.1\\\\n- Implement BUP enforcement preflight check (behavioral)\\\\n- Add version/hash meta to schema pointer memory entry\\\\n\\\\nNext Suggestions\\\\n- Confirm design priors\\\\n- Run first BUP at next session’s first message\\\\n- Execute Daily Recap at 18:00 Australia/Melbourne\\\\n\\\\nEOF\\\\n\\\\n# Create JSON sidecar\\\\ncat > \\\\\\\"$SUMMARY_JSON\\\\\\\" << EOF\\\\n{\\\\n  \\\\\\\"date_utc\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"$DATE\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"timestamp_utc\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"$TS\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"local_timezone\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Australia/Melbourne\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"artifacts\\\