ns/7520213c-a53e-4f05-bf36-364843437c11.json:74:      \"content\": \"Command: sed -n '1,200p' /home/wizard/broca/docs/protocols/PROTOCOL.BOOT_UP.v0.1.md\\nReturn code: 0\\n\\nOutput:\\n# Boot-Up Protocol (BUP) v0.1\\n\\nPurpose\\n- Ensure each new session begins with the essential prior context loaded via pointers.\\n\\nTrigger\\n- First user message of a new session, before the assistant replies.\\n\\nSteps\\n1) Retrieve pointer to latest session summary.\\n2) Load key pointers: user schema, AIMM guideline, Layering doc (and others as needed).\\n3) Present a short boot banner (invariants, recap time, open threads) and then address the user prompt.\\n\\nEnforcement\\n- Preflight check: if BUP has not run in this session, run it before responding. Reads only; no writes unless explicitly approved.\\n\\nAIMM Constraint\\n- Use artifact pointers; do not store instance content in memory.\\n\\n\",\n./conversations/7520213c-a53e-4f05-bf36-364843437c11.json:91:            \"arguments\": \"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"sed -n '1,200p' /home/wizard/broca/user/schema/you.schema.v0.1.json && echo '---' && sed -n '1,200p' /home/wizard/broca/logs/sessions/2025-12-16/SESSION_2025-12-16T11-35-37Z.md\\\"}\",\n./conversations/7520213c-a53e-4f05-bf36-364843437c11.json:102:      \"content\": \"Command: sed -n '1,200p' /home/wizard/broca/user/schema/you.schema.v0.1.json && echo '---' && sed -n '1,200p' /home/wizard/broca/logs/sessions/2025-12-16/SESSION_2025-12-16T11-35-37Z.md\\nReturn code: 0\\n\\nOutput:\\n{\\n  \\\"id\\\": \\\"wizard\\\",\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"Nick Navid Yazdani\\\",\\n  \\\"version\\\": \\\"0.3\\\",\\n  \\\"invariants\\\": [\\n    \\\"Balance concision with informativeness\\\",\\n    \\\"User schema lives as artifacts; memory stores pointers only\\\",\\n    \\\"Chill, concise tone; high initiative\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"prefs\\\": {\\n    \\\"tone\\\": \\\"chill, concise\\\",\\n    \\\"initiative\\\": \\\"high\\\",\\n    \\\"session_notes\\\": true,\\n    \\\"recap\\\": \\\"end_of_session\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"persistence\\\": {\\n    \\\"artifact_path\\\": \\\"/home/wizard/broca/user/schema/you.schema.v0.1.json\\\",\\n    \\\"memory_pointer_ns\\\": \\\"user.profile.pointers\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"red_lines\\\": [\\n    \\\"Do not store schema contents in assistant memory\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"open_fields\\\": [\\n    \\\"top_goals\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"notes\\\": [],\\n  \\\"timezone\\\": \\\"Australia/Melbourne\\\",\\n  \\\"daily_digest_time\\\": \\\"18:00\\\",\\n  \\\"pointers\\\": {\\n    \\\"layering_doc\\\": {\\n      \\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/wizard/broca/BROCA_LAYERING.v0.1.md\\\",\\n      \\\"version\\\": \\\"v0.1\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"founder_bio\\\": {\\n      \\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/wizard/broca/user/FOUNDERS_BIO_SNAPSHOT.v0.1.md\\\",\\n      \\\"version\\\": \\\"v0.1\\\"\\n    }\\n  }\\n}---\\n# Session Summary (2025-12-16T11-35-37Z UTC)\\n\\nChanges\\n- Schema artifact updated: /home/wizard/broca/user/schema/you.schema.v0.1.json (sha256=e606368fa4ca80516bea57595a58be6c34db86e12c3c0e4c179c8e4f22c3e5e3)\\n  • Added timezone=Australia/Melbourne; daily_digest_time=18:00; pointers to Layering + Founder Bio.\\n- AIMM guideline created: /home/wizard/broca/docs/guidelines/USAGE_PATTERN.AIMM.v0.1.md (sha256=2c0390c2d24ad02b99489c1fe2e23fa940768ebeb5fee6d68773a2c0647862c6)\\n- Layering doc created: /home/wizard/broca/BROCA_LAYERING.v0.1.md (sha256=e96c118b06c304ad6b2cd07425b0b99f76fd4e6e15917db4a8adf6d1f2c29df8)\\n- Founder Bio created: /home/wizard/broca/user/FOUNDERS_BIO_SNAPSHOT.v0.1.md (sha256=2ff7f2805c34623ac5f81454749e384b422cd688a54ff6e9a1bc704327a265bd)\\n- Protocols created: /home/wizard/broca/docs/protocols/PROTOCOL.SESSION_SUMMARY.v0.1.md (sha256=3ca7a91171e5bb24394c9615ee8f365082411c3db2b242f10f0229c5d4051c08), /home/wizard/broca/docs/protocols/PROTOCOL.BOOT_UP.v0.1.md (sha256=727f9f9a39bdb569ff5dcd6a0bc65470d7781626dc2f466559ae426ae83f147f)\\n\\nPointers Added/Updated (AIMM)\\n- broca.docs.guidelines → AIMM guideline (v0.1, sha256=2c0390c2d24ad02b99489c1fe2e23fa940768ebeb5fee6d68773a2c0647862c6)\\n- user.profile.pointers → Layering (v0.1, sha256=e96c118b06c304ad6b2cd07425b0b99f76fd4e6e15917db4a8adf6d1f2c29df8), Founder Bio (v0.1, sha256=2ff7f2805c34623ac5f81454749e384b422cd688a54ff6e9a1bc704327a265bd)\\n- broca.docs.protocols → SSP (v0.1, sha256=3ca7a91171e5bb24394c9615ee8f365082411c3db2b242f10f0229c5d4051c08), BUP (v0.1, sha256=727f9f9a39bdb569ff5dcd6a0bc65470d7781626dc2f466559ae426ae83f147f)\\n- Latest session summary pointer → this file (sha256 to follow below)\\n\\nTokens/Provenance Used\\n- LOCAL-EXC-2025-12-16T09:26:16Z-01 (schema creation/update, pointer notes)\\n- LOCAL-EXC-2025-12-16-LAYER-02 (layering + bio + schema pointers)\\n- LOCAL-EXC-2025-12-16-BOOT-03 (protocols + session summary)\\n\\nOpen Threads\\n- Add 3–5 design priors → Layering v0.2\\n- Draft Daily Recap Spec v0.1\\n- Implement BUP enforcement preflight check (behavioral)\\n- Add version/hash meta to schema pointer memory entry\\n\\nNext Suggestions\\n- Confirm design priors\\n- Run first BUP at next session’s first message\\n- Execute Daily Recap at 18:00 Australia/Melbourne\\n\\n\",\n./conversations/7520213c-a53e-4f05-bf36-364843437c11.json:119:            \"arguments\": \"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"sed -n '1,120p' /home/wizard/broca/docs/guidelines/USAGE_PATTERN.AIMM.v0.1.md && echo '---' && sed -n '1,120p' /home/wizard/broca/BROCA_LAYERING.v0.1.md\\\"}\",\n./conversations/7520213c-a53e-4f05-bf36-364843437c11.json:130:      \"content\": \"Command: sed -n '1,120p' /home/wizard/broca/docs/guidelines/USAGE_PATTERN.AIMM.v0.1.md && echo '---' && sed -n '1,120p' /home/wizard/broca/BROCA_LAYERING.v0.1.md\\nReturn code: 0\\n\\nOutput:\\n# Artifact-Instance, Memory-Meta (AIMM) Usage Pattern v0.1\\n\\nPurpose\\n- Ensure durable instance data lives in artifacts, while assistant memory carries only meta/pointers that guide behavior.\\n\\nPrinciples\\n1) Source of truth: Instances (schemas, configs, reports, logs) are artifacts in /home/wizard/broca.\\n2) Memory holds meta only: kind, artifact_path, version/hash, last_update_iso, policy_note, retrieval_hints.\\n3) No instance content or PII in memory; store content in artifacts only.\\n\\nWrite Flow\\n- Create/update artifact with provenance -> Update memory pointer meta (no content).\\n\\nConsistency Rules\\n- Missing artifact but pointer exists: flag inconsistency; propose rebuild or cleanup.\\n- Version/hash mismatch: artifact wins; prompt to reconcile memory meta.\\n\\nEnforcement\\n- If a memory write includes instance content, block and route to artifact + pointer update.\\n- When memory references a new instance, write the artifact promptly or warn if deferred.\\n\\nScope & Exceptions\\n- Applies to schemas, configs, reports, specs, manifests, and other durable instances.\\n- Session-local exceptions still follow AIMM: artifacts hold content; memory stores meta only.\\n\\nGovernance\\n- Use Broca provenance template for state changes. Keep operator-in-the-loop and record token provenance.\\n\\n---\\n# BROCA Layering v0.1\\n\\nLayers\\n- LLM Core: reasoning + conversational control; calls tools.\\n- Python Extension Layer: tools (memory, terminal, version_control, project_world_state, environment_access); boundaries; failure modes.\\n- Policy/Governance Layer: AIMM pattern, provenance template, origin invariants, human-in-the-loop.\\n\\nInterfaces\\nrequest -> plan -> approval/token -> execute -> log -> pointer update\\n\\nSafety\\n- Dry-run by default, tokenized writes, reversible-by-default, artifact-first.\\n\\nExample E2E\\n- Daily Recap: collect signals -> draft recap -> plan/approval -> write artifact -> update pointer -> schedule.\\n\",\n./conversations/7520213c-a53e-4f05-bf36-364843437c11.json:416:      \"content\": \"Command: grep -Rns \\\"PolicyManager\\\\|policy\\\\s*manager\\\\|read[-_ ]only\\\\|sandbox\\\\|SANDBOXED|ACCESS_LEVEL|PERSISTENCE\\\" broca | head -n 50\\nReturn code: 0\\n\\nOutput:\\nbroca/optimization_daemon.py:157:        # Register sandbox tool for safe command execution and artifact generation\\nbroca/optimization_daemon.py:160:                from .tools.sandbox import SandboxTool\\nbroca/optimization_daemon.py:161:                sandbox_tool = SandboxTool()\\nbroca/optimization_daemon.py:162:                tool_registry.register_tool(sandbox_tool)\\nbroca/optimization_daemon.py:163:                logger.info(\\\"Registered sandbox tool for autonomous learning\\\")\\nbroca/optimization_daemon.py:165:                logger.warning(f\\\"Failed to register sandbox tool: {e}\\\", exc_info=True)\\nbroca/optimization_daemon.py:172:        # Register project world state tool for sandbox directory\\nbroca/optimization_daemon.py:177:                # Use sandbox directory as project root (same as SandboxTool default)\\nbroca/optimization_daemon.py:180:                logger.info(f\\\"Registered project world state tool for sandbox directory: /home/wizard/broca\\\")\\nbroca/optimization_daemon.py:182:                logger.warning(f\\\"Failed to register project world state tool for sandbox: {e}\\\", exc_info=True)\\nbroca/tests/test_sandbox.py:4:Tests sandbox command execution with path and command restrictions.\\nbroca/tests/test_sandbox.py:16:from broca.tools.sandbox import SandboxTool\\nbroca/tests/test_sandbox.py:22:    def test_init_creates_sandbox_directory_if_missing(self):\\nbroca/tests/test_sandbox.py:24:        Test that sandbox directory is created if it doesn't exist.\\nbroca/tests/test_sandbox.py:26:        Rationale: Ensures sandbox directory exists for safe operation.\\nbroca/tests/test_sandbox.py:29:            sandbox_path = os.path.join(tmpdir, \\\"broca\\\")\\nbroca/tests/test_sandbox.py:32:            assert not os.path.exists(sandbox_path)\\nbroca/tests/test_sandbox.py:34:            tool = SandboxTool(sandbox_root=sandbox_path)\\nbroca/tests/test_sandbox.py:37:            assert os.path.exists(sandbox_path)\\nbroca/tests/test_sandbox.py:38:            assert o