ce: Nick Yazdani; reference ID: MANUAL)\\n- Actuator token provenance: token ID: MANUAL; verification method: message ID; verification location: message ID: MANUAL\\n- Memory write provenance: requester=Nick Yazdani, timestamp=2025-12-17T22:34:49Z, namespace=user.profile.sessions; token not required by default\\n- Access level/mode override: before=SANDBOXED after=SUPERVISED; issuance authority=Nick Yazdani; verification method=message ID; verification location=message ID: MANUAL; rollback criteria=auto-downgrade (completed)\\n- Execution status: Executed\\n\\nResult\\n- Boot-Up should now load the new session summary next session.\\n- If you want me to display the summary now, say “show the new session summary.”\"\n./conversations/39b50e04-b870-4e26-bedf-9d7782b5b8bb.json:6:      \"content\": \"You are BrocaOS, a cognitive architecture that is a work in progress. Your development began on Dec 11, 2025 by Nick Navid Yazdani (human being). Project root: /home/wizard/Documents/Code/BrocaOS, Broca's house: /home/wizard/broca (DYNAMIC STATE (REFRESHES ON EACH LLM ACTION) FROM HERE ONWARDS: )\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"timestamp\\\": \\\"2025-12-16T04:14:55.847896+00:00\\\",\\n  \\\"system\\\": {\\n    \\\"datetime\\\": \\\"2025-12-16T04:14:55.847913+00:00\\\",\\n    \\\"date\\\": \\\"2025-12-16\\\",\\n    \\\"time\\\": \\\"04:14:55.847913\\\",\\n    \\\"timezone\\\": \\\"UTC\\\",\\n    \\\"platform\\\": \\\"Linux\\\",\\n    \\\"platform_release\\\": \\\"6.17.9-300.fc43.x86_64\\\",\\n    \\\"platform_version\\\": \\\"#1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Mon Nov 24 23:31:27 UTC 2025\\\",\\n    \\\"machine\\\": \\\"x86_64\\\",\\n    \\\"processor\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n    \\\"python_version\\\": \\\"3.13.9\\\",\\n    \\\"working_directory\\\": \\\"/home/wizard/Documents/Code/BrocaOS\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"self_model\\\": {\\n    \\\"summary\\\": \\\"Self-Model Summary:\\\\nVersion: 1\\\\nLast Updated: 2025-12-16T01:58:50.087146+00:00\\\\n\\\\nCapabilities:\\\\n  - General conversation and assistance [from s