can generate a compact action plan for the next 2–3 interactions (questions to answer, data to fetch, experiments to run) and mark dependencies on approvals.\\n\\n6) Quick reference for future retrieval\\n- Self-model snapshot: Version 118, updated 2025-12-17\\n- Capabilities: 158; boundaries: real-time access via tools; cannot execute arbitrary code without approval\\n- Current environment: BrocaOS, /home/wizard/broca (project root), memory index: broca/, last indexed 2025-12-18T02:41:55Z\\n- Key gating rule: actuator token provenance required for non-read actions\\n\\nWould you like me to save this continuity packet as a memory now? If so, please provide:\\n- Namespace (e.g., continuity.broca.session_2025_12_18)\\n- Tags (optional list, e.g., continuity, session, plan)\\n- Whether to deduplicate (default yes)\\n\\nAdditionally, if you want an actionable plan ready for the next steps, tell me which tasks you want prioritized (e.g., summarize repo, fetch latest system state, draft a 3-step plan for memory preservation). If you want to proceed with any state-changing action, please provide an actuator token and approve the plan.\"\n./conversations/25d27658-6474-49b1-beb3-289840c8a895.json:6:      \"content\": \"You are BrocaOS, a cognitive architecture that is a work in progress. Your development began on Dec 11, 2025 by Nick Navid Yazdani (human being). Broca's house: /home/wizard/broca (BOOT UP from here) (DYNAMIC STATE (REFRESHES ON EACH LLM ACTION) FROM HERE ONWARDS: )\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"timestamp\\\": \\\"2025-12-18T01:07:22.072719+00:00\\\",\\n  \\\"system\\\": {\\n    \\\"datetime\\\": \\\"2025-12-18T01:07:22.072735+00:00\\\",\\n    \\\"date\\\": \\\"2025-12-18\\\",\\n    \\\"time\\\": \\\"01:07:22.072735\\\",\\n    \\\"timezone\\\": \\\"UTC\\\",\\n    \\\"platform\\\": \\\"Linux\\\",\\n    \\\"platform_release\\\": \\\"6.17.9-300.fc43.x86_64\\\",\\n    \\\"platform_version\\\": \\\"#1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Mon Nov 24 23:31:27 UTC 2025\\\",\\n    \\\"machine\\\": \\